# Tests

## Purpose

This folder contains documentation of controlled tests performed to validate the Windows security monitoring and detection rules developed in this project.

## Testing Objectives

- Verify that relevant Windows security events are generated.
- Confirm that expected event information is recorded.
- Validate detection logic against controlled test scenarios.
- Identify limitations and potential false positives.

## Test Documentation

Each test will record:

- Test identification and objective.
- Test environment.
- Procedure followed.
- Expected results.
- Actual results.
- Pass or fail status.
- Observations and limitations.

## Testing Approach

Testing will be performed using controlled and authorised activities within the local Windows environment.

Test results will be compared against expected Windows security event records and documented detection behaviour.

## Current Status

Controlled testing has not yet started.
